{"title": "Bardic Inspiration (passive feature)", "pageid": 40229, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Bardic_Inspiration_(passive_feature)", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Bardic_Inspiration_(disambiguation)\" title=\"Bardic Inspiration (disambiguation)\">Bardic Inspiration (disambiguation)</a>        </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Bardic_Roll.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/Bardic_Roll.webp/300px-Bardic_Roll.webp, /w/images/5/56/Bardic_Roll.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/Bardic_Roll.webp/300px-Bardic_Roll.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/56/Bardic_Roll.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Bardic Inspiration</b> is a passive feature that allows the user to bardically inspire their allies and influence the outcome of their rolls.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Can use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bardic_Inspiration_(class_action)\" title=\"Bardic Inspiration (class action)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/25px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/38px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/50px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bardic Inspiration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/25px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bardic_Inspiration_(class_action)\" title=\"Bardic Inspiration (class action)\">Bardic Inspiration</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\"> Grants: </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bardic_Inspiration_(class_action)\" title=\"Bardic Inspiration (class action)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/40px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/60px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/80px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bardic Inspiration (class action)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/40px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bardic_Inspiration_(class_action)\" title=\"Bardic Inspiration (class action)\">Bardic Inspiration (class action)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Amira\" title=\"Amira\">Amira</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Brinna_Brightsong\" title=\"Brinna Brightsong\">Brinna Brightsong</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dimp